{"type":"text","timestamp":1794327207151,"sessionID":"ses_e39d791dbffedR0nf9BbB726GN","part":{"id":"prt_1c63c5cd5001SZTWJtHkDGGMfS","messageID":"msg_1c63c402d001p3Z5L8jllq94h3","sessionID":"ses_e39d791dbffedR0nf9BbB726GN","type":"text","text":"Done. The app is complete and verified end-to-end.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, stdlib-only: sqlite3 + werkzeug hashing):\n- Token auth (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`, random urlsafe tokens in SQLite); `admin` account synced from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup — sign-in disabled (401) when unset/empty.\n- All endpoints per spec, exact response shapes (`items`/`total`/`page`/`page_size`, availability `time`/`booked`/`remaining`).\n- Ownership isolation: other users' reservations return 404; capacity enforced at 20/slot inside `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transactions (PUT excludes the row's own guests; refusals change nothing); omitted `notes` cleared on PUT.\n- Data persists in `./data/reservations.db` (WAL), verified across restarts.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`, React+TS+Vite+Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, only `src/index.css` as Tailwind entry):\n- Register/sign-in, signed-in username + sign-out (auto sign-out on 401), day picker with live availability (booked/remaining, \"Full\" badges), booking/edit form showing API error messages verbatim (incl. full-slot refusals), reservations grouped by date with edit + confirm-dialog cancel, admin view of the chosen day's reservations with guest totals and pagination.\n\n**Verified**: `npm ci` + `npm run build` reproduce cleanly, `tsc --noEmit` passes, and a live gunicorn smoke test passed all flows (health, auth, 404-isolation, capacity, admin pagination, SPA serving, persistence). Lock files updated (tailwind pinned to resolved 4.3.5; `requirements.lock` untouched since no Python deps were added).","time":{"start":1794327207125,"end":1794327207129}}}
